2 DATE 3 MAR 1761
1 OCCU Vicar of Landrake & St Ermey
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Reverend of Landrake, firstly married his cousin Isabella Keigwin, daughter of John Keigwin and Mary Penrose and secondly married Prudence Busvargus (widow of  Rev Jonathan Toup).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from first marriage:
2 CONT
2 CONT :1. Rev James Keigwin, Vicar of Betchworth in Surrey, born 1714 unmarried, no issue, died 1805.
2 CONT :2. Isabella, died 1733, unmarried, no issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from second marriage:
2 CONT
2 CONT :1. William, unmarried, no issue. :2. John, unmarried :3. Prudence, married Charles Worth :4. Anne, born 1731, married John Blake.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
