2 CONT
2 CONT Children:	Stephen Pawley, Henry Pawley, Ambrose Pawley, John Pawley, George Pawley, Florence Pawley, Margaret Chepman (born Pawley), Margeria Chepman (born Pawley), Prudence Praed Praed (born Pawley)
