2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:	1524 - St Uny, Lelant, Cornwall, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Death:	May 1 1578 - St Uny, Lelant, St Ives Bay, Cornwall, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:	Stephan Pawley, Margery Pawley (born Brea)
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother:	Thomas Pawley
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife:	Jane Pawley (born Samford)
