1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Although I couldn't find a birth record for Charity, there are 2 reasons why I'm convinced she's the daughter of Edward Grenfell and Charity Wallis.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Her name is the same as her Mother's and they gave their son Henry a second name of Wallish (his Mother's maiden name).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2)On the 1851 census Thomas and Charity are living next to Charity's brother Richard Grenfell.
