1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William H. Thomas and wife owned land just east of Springfield during the 1870's and 1880's. They were listed in the 1880 census of Cass Township, with their children. W. H. Thomas was a patron of the 1876 Illustra
2 CONC ted Historical Atlas Map of Greene Co., Mo., published by Brink, McDonough & Co. He resided in Sec. 13, T. 29, R. 21., and was a farmer and stock raiser.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Henry Thomas was born 21 July 1845 in Greene County, Missouri (Missouri State Board of Health, Bureau of Vital Statistics, Certificate of Death, File No. 2090). He married to Sinia E. Harris on 07 January 1866 in Greene Co
2 CONC ., MO (Greene County, Missouri Marriage Record Volume C 1865-1874, p. 440). In 1870, William and Sinia Thomas resided in Campbell Township, Springfield P. O., Greene Co., MO. In 1880, Wm. H. and Sina E. Thomas resided in Cass Town
2 CONC ship, Greene Co., MO. In 1900, William H. and Sinia E. Thomas resided in North Campbell Township, City of Springfield, Greene Co., MO. In 1910, William H. and Sinia E. Thomas were residing in the City of St. Louis, MO, with their 
2 CONC son-in-law Thomas J. Reese. In 1920, William H. and Sinia E. Thomas resided in the City of St. Louis, MO. William Henry Thomas died on 03 January 1921 in St. Louis, Missouri as the result of trauma in an automobile accident, and w
2 CONC as buried at National Cemetery on 07 January 1921. He was survived by his wife (Missouri State Board of Health, Bureau of Vital Statistics, Certificate of Death, File No. 2090).
