1 NOTE {geni:about_me} James Trembath and Susan Gale were born near one another in England , but did not meet until they both came to the United States. Susa n pushed James into a pond on her brother, Tom's, place in Ohio.
2 CONT
2 CONT There is some dispute about date of birth. Barbara Lein found his da te of christening as 28 March 1852 St. Just-in-Penwith, Cornwall, Eng land according to Mormon records. The Surname Archive in West Suse x England found a birth 
2 CONC certificate for James Trembath born 27 Februa ry 1852. His tombstone says 21 February, 1852, but that could have b een a 7 misread as a 1.
