1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''FreeBMD Births: Jun 1840 - Charlotte James, Penzance 9 187'''
2 CONT
2 CONT GRO Certified Birth Certificate (obtained 6 Sep 2013): Registration District: Penzance Union, 1840 Birth in Sub-district of Saint Just in Penwith in the County of Cornwall.
2 CONT
2 CONT No: 277, Born: 29 Mar 1840 at Trewellard St Just, Name: Charlotte, Sex: Girl, Father: Noah James, Mother: Elizabeth James, formerly Roberts, Father's Occupation: Farmer, Informant: Elizabeth James - Mother - Trewellard, St Just, R
2 CONC egistered: 9 Apr 1840, Registrar: John Davey.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Request for BMD index recorded for Penzance on vol 9 page 187 for the June quarter resulted in a certified birth certificate with No. 277.  The registration date (9 Apr) determines the quarter for the index, whereas the actu
2 CONC al birth was 29 Mar.  Apparently, the earlier date recorded as her birth date must have been her baptism date (22 Apr); many other WikiTree family tree sites also show it as 22 Apr 1840 too.  Also, her father Noah James was identi
2 CONC fied as a Farmer in 1840, whereas later when she was married in 1862 he was an InnKeeper then.
2 CONT
2 CONT The birth date was updated based on GRO certified birth certificate, and also added Trewellard as the birth Place in St Just in Penwith where she was born.
2 CONT
2 CONT FreeBMD Marriages: Mar 1862 - Charlotte James, Penzance 5c 473.
2 CONT
