1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Elizabeth was baptised on 15th May 1825 (born 1824 according to 1851 census, born 1826 according to 1891 census), the daughter of Martyn and Joannah GRENFELL. She married William RICHARDS on 13 September 1845 when she was 20. Her 
2 CONC occupation on their marriage certificate is given as servant. They had 5 children (see RICHARDS). On the 1851 census she was living in Meadow Place Paul with her father, Martin Grenfell, and her 2 sons, William and Richard Tremewe
2 CONC n (b 1849, evidence: birth cert). Elizabeth was illiterate; she made her mark on Richard’s birth certificate. Richard Trenoweth Richards was not born until 1855 (birth cert). It is not known when she died.
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
